  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia Crises 2 Resilience (EC2R)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ethiopia Crises to Resilience (EC2R) programme is aimed to alleviate the impact of the conflict and drought to the poorest Ethiopians. The programme tries to address urgent humanitarian needs while maintaining the delivery of essential services across the country.</narrative>
  </description>
